`"},"3042":{"id":"/wiki/booblik-app/booblikconfigtest-21","page_id":"/wiki/booblik-app/booblikconfigtest","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/wiki/booblik-app/booblikconfigtest#validation-of-segmentmode-and-fetchmode","content":"`booblik.transport`"},"3043":{"id":"/wiki/booblik-app/booblikconfigtest-22","page_id":"/wiki/booblik-app/booblikconfigtest","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/wiki/booblik-app/booblikconfigtest#validation-of-segmentmode-and-fetchmode","content":"`Transport`"},"3044":{"id":"/wiki/booblik-app/booblikconfigtest-23","page_id":"/wiki/booblik-app/booblikconfigtest","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/wiki/booblik-app/booblikconfigtest#validation-of-segmentmode-and-fetchmode","content":"`SELECTOR`"},"3045":{"id":"/wiki/booblik-app/booblikconfigtest-24","page_id":"/wiki/booblik-app/booblikconfigtest","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/wiki/booblik-app/booblikconfigtest#failure-modes-and-startup-refusal","content":"The broker is designed to refuse to boot if configuration errors are detected, preventing \"surprises at three in the morning\" (`BooblikConfigTest.kt:16`). Specific failure modes include:"},"3046":{"id":"/wiki/booblik-app/booblikconfigtest-25","page_id":"/wiki/booblik-app/booblikconfigtest","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/wiki/booblik-app/booblikconfigtest#failure-modes-and-startup-refusal","content":"**Type Mismatches:** Providing a non-integer value for a numeric field (e.g., `booblik.port=nine-thousand`) results in an `IllegalStateException` (`BooblikConfigTest.kt:67`)."},"3047":{"id":"/wiki/booblik-app/booblikconfigtest-26","page_id":"/wiki/booblik-app/booblikconfigtest","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/wiki/booblik-app/booblikconfigtest#failure-modes-and-startup-refusal","content":"**Invalid Ranges:** Port numbers must be within `0..65535` (`BooblikConfig.kt:50`)."},"3048":{"id":"/wiki/booblik-app/booblikconfigtest-27","page_id":"/wiki/booblik-app/booblikconfigtest","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/wiki/booblik-app/booblikconfigtest#failure-modes-an