nKey.interestOps` from a thread other than the selector thread can be ineffective or block (`SelectorLoop.kt:26-28`)."},"3825":{"id":"/wiki/booblik-net-107","page_id":"/wiki/booblik-net","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/wiki/booblik-net#behaviour-that-surprises","content":"`BlockingConnection`'s `transferFrom` method may enter a tight loop if `segment.transferTo` returns zero, as it treats zero as \"try again immediately\" rather than waiting (`Connection.kt:134`)."},"3826":{"id":"/wiki/booblik-net-108","page_id":"/wiki/booblik-net","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/wiki/booblik-net#behaviour-that-surprises","content":"`BooblikServer` uses a `SupervisorJob` for its scope so that a failure in a single client session does not crash the entire server (`BooblikServer.kt:185-186`)."},"3827":{"id":"/wiki/booblik-net/transport","page_id":"/wiki/booblik-net/transport","type":"page","content":"Transport","breadcrumbs":["Docs","Wiki","booblik-net"],"tags":[],"url":"/wiki/booblik-net/transport"},"3828":{"id":"/wiki/booblik-net/transport-0","page_id":"/wiki/booblik-net/transport","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/wiki/booblik-net/transport#diagram","content":"Diagram"},"3829":{"id":"/wiki/booblik-net/transport-1","page_id":"/wiki/booblik-net/transport","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/wiki/booblik-net/transport#transport-modes","content":"Transport modes"},"3830":{"id":"/wiki/booblik-net/transport-2","page_id":"/wiki/booblik-net/transport","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/wiki/booblik-net/transport#selectorloop-mechanics","content":"SelectorLoop mechanics"},"3831":{"id":"/wiki/booblik-net/transport-3","page_id":"/wiki/booblik-net/transport","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/wiki/booblik-net/transport#selectorconnection-and-suspension","content":"SelectorConnection and suspension"},"3832":{"id":"/wiki/booblik-net/transport-4","page_id":"/wiki/booblik-net/transport","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/wiki/booblik-net/transport#blockingconnection-and-virtual-threads","content":