t in a silent corruption rather than an optimization `README.md:41-42`."},"4238":{"id":"/wiki/dev-projection/the-build-lifecycle-33","page_id":"/wiki/dev-projection/the-build-lifecycle","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/wiki/dev-projection/the-build-lifecycle#behaviour-that-surprises","content":"**Replay Completion**: The `replayComplete` flag is only set once the `replay` flow from the subscriber actually completes `Main.kt:105`."},"4239":{"id":"/wiki/dev-projection/the-build-lifecycle-34","page_id":"/wiki/dev-projection/the-build-lifecycle","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/wiki/dev-projection/the-build-lifecycle#behaviour-that-surprises","content":"**Non-monotonicity in `follow`**: While `follow` ensures the view stays current, the `follow` phase does not end, unlike `replay` which terminates once the high watermark is reached `Main.kt:35`."},"4240":{"id":"/wiki/dev-publisher","page_id":"/wiki/dev-publisher","type":"page","content":"dev/publisher","breadcrumbs":["Docs","Wiki","dev/publisher"],"tags":[],"url":"/wiki/dev-publisher"},"4241":{"id":"/wiki/dev-publisher-0","page_id":"/wiki/dev-publisher","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/wiki/dev-publisher#diagram","content":"Diagram"},"4242":{"id":"/wiki/dev-publisher-1","page_id":"/wiki/dev-publisher","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/wiki/dev-publisher#publisherconfig","content":"PublisherConfig"},"4243":{"id":"/wiki/dev-publisher-2","page_id":"/wiki/dev-publisher","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/wiki/dev-publisher#openconnection","content":"openConnection"},"4244":{"id":"/wiki/dev-publisher-3","page_id":"/wiki/dev-publisher","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/wiki/dev-publisher#publishforever","content":"publishForever"},"4245":{"id":"/wiki/dev-publisher-4","page_id":"/wiki/dev-publisher","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/wiki/dev-publisher#publishtasks","content":"publishTasks"},"4246":{"id":"/wiki/dev-publisher-5","page_id":"/wiki/dev-publisher","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/wiki/dev-publisher#stats","cont